{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].\n\nThe handbook's parking rule specifies that bays 12 through 30 are reserved for members' vehicles [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].\n\nAdditionally, the handbook states that there is a time limit of two hours for parking in these reserved spaces [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"384c89f4648259037ce2039d45189ba612b775d07e71e487f7480bbec53ad79a","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the handbook's parking rule, reserved spaces (bays 12 through 30), and the time limit, each followed by exact citations from the handbook source obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab as required."}